        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/shadow-of-the-colossus-crop-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>It's been six years since PlayStation nuked its forums, taking with it one of video gaming's most legendary communities - a team of dedicated secret-hunters convinced Fumito Ueda's <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/shadow-of-the-colossus\">Shadow of the Colossus</a> held one last mystery, and who invested almost a decade trying to find it. And now, speaking to Eurogamer following <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/fumito-ueda-shadow-of-the-colossus-ico-gen-atlas-or-xbox-playstation-pc\">the reveal of his latest game Gen Atlas</a>, Ueda has shared his thoughts on the fascination his acclaimed games have inspired among fans.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/shadow-colossus-secret-fumita-ueda-responds\">Read more</a></p>",
